  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OUR MISSION: Figure Skating in Harlem helps girls transform their lives and grow in confidence, leadership and academic achievement. We are the only organization in the world for girls of color that combines the power of education with access to the artistic discipline of figure skating to build champions in life.   OUR VISION: To empower every young girl with the skills and foundation to achieve her dreams.</narrative>
